From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nopjmp <kthompson@hey.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Dec 2021 19:16:11 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 051/137] Use more fastutil data structures

- Backport Dionysus server/0034-Use-more-fastutil-data-structures.patch
- Source: https://github.com/nopjmp/Dionysus at b5c71b62f6f1f555b22bd52f5751e33be4690b6e
- ChunkProviderServer: use LongSet/LongOpenHashSet and LongIterator for unloadQueue
- HandshakeListener: use Object2LongOpenHashMap for connection throttle tracker
- MethodProfiler: use fastutil ObjectArrayList, LongArrayList and Object2LongOpenHashMap
- PlayerList: use fastutil Object2ObjectOpenHashMap with case-insensitive strategy
- CraftMetaItem: replace Trove attribute trackers with Object2DoubleOpenHashMap
- SpigotConfig: replace Trove forcedStats with Object2IntOpenHashMap
- Remove legacy Trove CaseInsensitiveMap and CaseInsensitiveHashingStrategy

